 stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-34\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"722\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"1723\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"2112\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"2891\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"3391\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"4059\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(5115,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-36\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Half of the major axis is called a <strong>semi-major axis</strong>. For our ellipse above, the length of the semi-major axis is <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"6.906ex\" height=\"5.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1437.2 2973.6 2228.5\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\\dfrac{6}{2} = 3.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-36\" d=\"M42 313Q42 476 123 571T303 666Q372 666 402 630T432 550Q432 525 418 510T379 495Q356 495 341 509T326 548Q326 592 373 601Q351 623 311 626Q240 626 194 566Q147 500 147 364L148 360Q153 366 156 373Q197 433 263 433H267Q313 433 348 414Q372 400 396 374T435 317Q456 268 456 210V192Q456 169 451 149Q440 90 387 34T253 -22Q225 -22 199 -14T143 16T92 75T56 172T42 313ZM257 397Q227 397 205 380T171 335T154 278T148 216Q148 133 160 97T198 39Q222 21 251 21Q302 21 329 59Q342 77 347 104T352 209Q352 289 347 316T329 361Q302 397 257 397Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449