4Q393 47 442 46H471V0H462ZM293 211V545L74 212L183 211H293Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-33\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"722\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"1723\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"2112\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"2891\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"3391\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"4059\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(5115,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-34\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Half of the minor axis is called a <strong>semi-minor axis</strong>. For our ellipse, the semi-minor axis has a length of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"6.906ex\" height=\"5.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1437.2 2973.6 2228.5\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">\\dfrac{4}{2} = 2.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMAIN-34\" d=\"M462 0Q444 3 333 3Q217 3 199 0H190V46H221Q241 46 248 46T265 48T279 53T286 61Q287 63 287 115V165H28V211L179 442Q332 674 334 675Q336 677 355 677H373L379 671V211H471V165H379V114Q379 73 379 66T385 54Q393 47 442 46H471V0H462ZM293 211V545L74 212L183 211H293Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H4